This crate is openraft from https://github.com/databendlabs/openraft, commit
8175ca602330a4534a25190d9b64a182859cec9c of its main branch, published under
the name coordinode-openraft. Its source is unchanged, except
src/core/balancer.rs, which is that file as of the later main commit
b89a3bf271ea4762576ecdb58b2bf7e407849131 (the API drain budget grows back
from one message per round). Cargo.toml is rewritten for the new package name
and README.md describes this package.

